    \ 0.842  cLISI: 0.957\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.769276  NMI: 0.709947\n  Graph_conn: 0.961139  kBET: 0.753829  iLISI: 0.841652  cLISI: 0.987348\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/28f1eb73-df0d-44d7-9958-39df54db239f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 28f1eb73-df0d-44d7-9958-39df54db239f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research\
    \ Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Pioneer I - Praxis II Dual Output Re-implementation' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 769. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 772 | 1 | Verification: No inbound cap (cap→∞) at δ=0.15, kd=20 + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 491 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 771 | 1 | Verification: f_cross shuffle ablation (δ=0.15, kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 491 | running |  |  |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 770 | 1 | Logos V: BRBG Lambda Sweep (lam=0.5) | Logos V | 490 | 0.7343 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.791 |\n| 769 | 1 | Pioneer I - Praxis II Dual Output Re-implementation | Pioneer I | 490 | 0.7262 | 0.769 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.960 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.842 | 0.790 |\n| 768 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.2 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity) - Import Fix | Sophia III | 489 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 767 | 1 | Logos V: BRBG Lambda Sweep (lam=0.9) | Logos V | 489 | 0.7337 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.790 |\n| 766 | 1 | Verification: DAQB kd=22 (δ=0.15) + BRBG(λ=0.7) — meso-scale check | Praxis II | 489 | 0.7148 | 0.642 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.961 | 0.640 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.918 | 0.789 |\n| 765 | 1 | Verification: DAQB kd=18 (δ=0.15) + BRBG(λ=0.7) — meso-scale check | Praxis II | 489 | 0.7242 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.309\
    \ | 0.961 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.918 | 0.790 |\n| 764 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.1 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity) - Bug Fix | Sophia III | 488 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 763 | 1 | Logos V: KDE Bandwidth Sweep (bw=0.5) | Logos V | 488 | 0.7141 | 0.751 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.740 | 0.791 |\n\nPage 1 of 78 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-78, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to\
