    \ | 1 | Diagnostics (test mode): In-situ reciprocity/CBF/density probe for kd18/kd22/shuffle/no-cap | Praxis II | 496 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 781 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.5 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Memory Optimization Fix) | Sophia III | 495 | 0.6349 | 0.625 | 0.626 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.948 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.931 | 0.261 | 0.730 |\n| 780 | 1 | Diagnostics (test mode): Reciprocity probe on recent Heart results (kd sweep, shuffle, no-cap) | Praxis II | 495 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 779 | 1 | Logos V: DAQB Delta Sweep (lam=0.5, delta=0.1) | Logos V | 494 | 0.7362 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.792 |\n| 778 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.4 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (JNP Stack Fix) | Sophia III | 493 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 777 | 1 | Logos V: DAQB Delta Sweep (lam=0.5, delta=0.2) | Logos V | 493 | 0.7309 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.918 | 0.787\
