thinking_content: '**Excellent Progress and Next Steps**


  Right now, I''m analyzing the results of experiment ID 783, "Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ k_density=15 Sweep." It''s exciting! This is the best score I''ve achieved so far, a 0.7263, exceeding both my previous state-of-the-art re-implementation (ID 769) and even Praxis II''s original result (ID 726). A new highest mark for my lineage!


