    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 795 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ beta=3.0 Sweep (k_density=15, delta=0.1) | Pioneer I | 508 | 0.7230 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.958 | 0.808 | 0.789 |\n| 794 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=18, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 507 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n| 793 | 1 | Logos V: Generalization Test (lam=0.5, delta=0.1, k_total=40) | Logos V | 505 | 0.7345 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.943 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 792 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ beta=3.0 Sweep | Pioneer I | 504 | 0.7301 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.397 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.958 | 0.808 | 0.789 |\n| 791 | 1 | Fix: No inbound cap (cap→∞) at δ=0.16 (kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 504 | 0.7259 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.254 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.926 | 0.788 |\n| 790 | 1 | Fix: f_cross shuffle ablation at δ=0.14 (kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) |\
