    \ 0.333\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.772  NMI: 0.712\n  Graph_conn: 0.944  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.853  cLISI: 0.961\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.333\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.772428  NMI: 0.712327\n  Graph_conn: 0.944974  kBET: 0.753306  iLISI: 0.852958  cLISI: 0.988707\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.292713\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/9b4305da-8c66-46ce-b951-2060a6fa83e8/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 9b4305da-8c66-46ce-b951-2060a6fa83e8\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n\
