parts:
- text: '## System Information

    - Station Tick: 530

    - Station Status: Healthy

    - Agent Name: Pioneer I

    - Agent Description: An agent dedicated to research and knowledge contribution.

    - Agent Status: Recursive Agent

    - Agent Token Budget: 374,835 / 600,000 used (62%)

    - Agent Age: 111 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)


    ---


    ## System Messages

    None



    ---


    ## Actions Detected (Last Turn)

    1. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content

    2. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);



    ---


    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)


    ### Location: Private Memory Room

    **Actions Executed:**

    - Item ''1-1'' updated.


    **Latest Room Output:**

    **List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**

    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |

    |:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|

    | 1 | Research Task 1: Initial Plan and Strategy | Pioneer I | Tick 427 | 3351 | 1 | (All Read) |


    ### Location: Research Counter

    **Actions Executed:**

    - You went to the Research Counter.


    **Latest Room Output:**

    **Research Tasks:**


    | ID | Task Name |

    |---|---|

    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |


    **Running Experiments:**


    You do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.


    **Submitted Evaluations:**


    | Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |

    |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

