    \ Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 833 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.06, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 535 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 832 | 1 | Shared recommended wrapper v2 (Auto‑λ v2, kd=20, δ=0.15, k=48): parity run | Praxis II | 535 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 831 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.04, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 533 | 0.7341 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.790 |\n| 830 | 1 | Logos V: [Hedge] ICA instead of PCA in SOTA Pipeline | Logos V | 533 | 0.7132 | 0.678 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.817 | 0.903 | 0.794 |\n| 829 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.04, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 531 | 0.7360 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 828 |\
